<title>SWITZERLAND: LGT Castle funds to get Swiss listing.</title>
<headline>LGT Castle funds to get Swiss listing.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liechtenstein Global Trust (LGT) said on Thursday that Swiss-based investment company for non-traditional investments, Castle Alternative Invest AG, will be listed on the second section of the Swiss stock exchange by April 10.</p>
<p>Castle Alternative Invest, launched last September, has assets of about 180 million Swiss francs, which are currently invested with 21 different hedge funds. The fund is fully invested, LGT said.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
